      "spam": false,
      "value": "Okay, so imagine this...\n\nGet an email and/or notification in-game for a developer conference event. Within a certain time before or during the event, join and chose public or private event options. Public places you in a random instance with other people. Private creates your own instance to invite your friends. In the event menu, there is a list of friends' private instances that you can choose to join.\n\nOnce it's about to begin, get an invite for the event that enters you into the world where you can then take your seat. The developers running the conference and all their actions would then be duplicated across all instances.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
